# Copy to .env.local and fill in.

# Google Maps JavaScript API key, used by the service-area map.
#
# ⚠️  This value is embedded in the client bundle and is PUBLICLY VISIBLE —
#     that is unavoidable for the Maps JS API. Secure it in Google Cloud
#     Console instead:
#       1. APIs & Services → Credentials → your key → Application restrictions
#       2. Set "Websites" and allow ONLY:  https://drillmaster.sk/*
#          (add http://localhost:3000/* for local development)
#       3. API restrictions → allow only "Maps JavaScript API"
#       4. Set a billing budget + alert on the project
#     Without a referrer restriction anyone can copy the key and bill it to you.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=
